IT:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ah, non hai potuto consegnare
il pacco {{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Beh, allora ridammelo.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Ci penso io!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Du konntest es nicht an {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
ausliefern?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Na, dann gib's eben wieder her, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
dann mach ich's später selber.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}¿Que no has podido entregar
mi ofrenda de paz a {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Tranqui, casi es mejor así.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¿Me la devuelves?

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Du konntest mein Geschenk zur
Entschuldigung nicht an {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
ausliefern, hm?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ach, ich hätte das gleich von Anfang
an selbst in die Hand nehmen sollen.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich nehm's mir wieder!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Sanırım o özür hediyesi teslim
edilemedi. Sorun değil; {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} {{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
tarafına {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}kendim götürürüm. Bana {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
geri verir misin?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}So,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} you never returned what I'd
borrowed from {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}I guess I should have done it myself.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}OK, give it back.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}¿Eh?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¿Todavía no le has dado
el paquete a {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}¡Ay, bichejo! ¡Me pones en un apuro!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Dámelo, porfa.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Sanırım{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} o ödünç aldığım şey
teslim edilemedi. Sorun değil; {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} {{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}
tarafına kendim götürürüm. Bana {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}
geri verir misin?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Lo he pensado, y creo que debería
entregarle el paquete a {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
yo misma.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Perdona por el lío.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¿Me lo devuelves, {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Sanırım o unutulan eşya teslim {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
edilemedi. Sorun değil; {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
tarafına kendim {{TAG:0003:0025:}}götürürüm. Bana
geri verir misin? {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}¿Al final no has podido llevarle
el paquete a {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}No te preocupes, calabacín.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Devuélvemelo y yo me ocupo.

EN:
Sorry to have troubled you. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}I should
have realized it's best to deliver a
present in person!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

ES:
Siento haberte involucrado, cielín.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}¡Será mejor que se lo dé yo misma,
en persona!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

FR:
Désolée de t'avoir dérang{{TAG:000E:0006:0200E9000400E9006500}}. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Bien
sûr, il est toujours préférable
d'offrir un cadeau en personne !{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
Mi dispiace averti disturbato. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Avrei
dovuto saperlo da sola che è meglio
consegnare i regalini di persona!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

DE:
Ich wollte dir keine Umstände
machen. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ich hätte mich von Anfang
an nicht davor drücken sollen...{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

TRANSLATION:
Bu hediyeyi kendim vermem{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}} daha
doğru. Seni uğraştırdığım için
özür dilerim.{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

EN:
Sorry to have troubled you. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}It's
better to apologize directly to
the injured party anyway!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

ES:
Siento las molestias, cielo.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}¡Pero será mejor que
se lo lleve en persona!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

FR:
Désolée de t'avoir dérang{{TAG:000E:0006:0200E9000400E9006500}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}} Et puis
c'est mieux comme ça :{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} un cadeau,
ça se donne en mains propres !{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
Scusa il disturbo! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Se si ha qualcosa
da consegnare, è sempre meglio
andare di persona!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

DE:
Ich wollte dir keine Umstände
machen. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}So was macht man
wirklich besser selbst.{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

TRANSLATION:
Özrümü kendim iletmem {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}daha
doğru. Seni uğraştırdığım için
özür dilerim.{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Perdona por las prisas. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Ahora mismo iré a dárselo
y a disculparme.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Entschuldige die Umstände!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Ich liefere es selbst ab und
entschuldige mich noch mal.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Se lo llevaré ahora mismito.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¡Seguro que {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} estará
muy preocupad{{TAG:000E:0008:00CD02006F00020061000000}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I want to get it back to {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
as soon as possible,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} so I'll take it
myself.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Thanks, anyway.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}¡Un segundo! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}¡Está abierto!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}¡Se suponía que era un regalito
especial de disculpa!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}Aspetta un secondo!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Perché questo
pacco è stato aperto?!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Era un regalo speciale di scuse!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}What!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} You opened it?!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}I guess it's
not worth getting too mad over.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
But now I have to rewrap it.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}¡Eh! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}¡¿Lo has abierto?!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Supongo que no debería enfadarme,
{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}pero ahora lo tengo que envolver.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}Cosa!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} L'hai aperto?!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}Non vale
la pena perdere l'autocontrollo...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Però lo devo incartare di nuovo...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0011:}}Ama {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}bu hiç hoş {{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}olmadı. Geri
verilecek şeyi açmamalıydın{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}};
lütfen bir daha yapma.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}Wait a second! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Who opened this?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}
Even though this is {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}'s 
package,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} you still opened it?!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}He, Moment! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Hast du das{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} etwa{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
aufgemacht?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Das ist doch für {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}, und
du hast es einfach so geöffnet?!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}Bir saniye! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Bunu kim açtı?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}
Bu {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} kişisinin paketi olduğu
hâlde,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} yine de açtın mı?!

{{TAG:0003:0011:}}Ne?! Barışma hediyesi kayboldu {{TAG:0007:0001:}}
mu{{TAG:0003:000E:}}? {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Bu gerçekten kötü oldu.
Şimdi durumu düzeltmem gerek.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}¿Lo has perdido? ¡Nooo!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}¡¿Cómo le digo yo a {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
que se lo he perdido?!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}Ne?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Kaybettin mi?!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:000D:}}Ama onu {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
kişisinden ödünç almıştım!{{TAG:0007:0000:19000000}}
Teknik olarak benim bile değildi!
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Şimdi ne yapacağım?

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}Pardon ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Tu as perdu le colis ?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Bravo ! Comment je vais pouvoir
expliquer ça à {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}, moi...

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}¡¿Que has perdido el paquete?!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}¿Y ahora yo qué hago? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}¡{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
estará impaciente por recibirlo!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}Was?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Du hast es verloren?!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Was soll ich denn jetzt nur machen?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} hat sich doch schon
darauf gefreut!
